* 7-5 電力計の接続 (src): W1 = 1 V (振幅)、1 kHz、負荷 R_L = 100 Ω + C1 = 1 µF、R_C = 10 Ω、R_P = 2.2 kΩ。電圧 = V_P の節点、電流 = R_C の電圧 ÷ 10 Ω
.ac list 1k
V1 s 0 AC 1
RP s 0 2.2k
RC s a 10
RL a b 100
C1 b 0 1u
.meas ac m_vp FIND mag(V(s)) AT 1k
.meas ac p_vp FIND ph(V(s)) AT 1k
.meas ac m_ic FIND mag(V(s,a)) AT 1k
.meas ac p_ic FIND ph(V(s,a)) AT 1k
